# The real template, matching every variable the production stack actually
# reads (verified 2026-09-06 against the live .env, not assumed — see
# docs/DISASTER-DRILL.md achado 6), lives at:
#
#     deploy/supabase/.env.example
#
# Copy THAT file to deploy/supabase/.env, not this one to a root .env — this
